<title>USA: Aspen Technology Inc Q3 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Aspen Technology Inc Q3 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Mass. 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Dollars in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>				Three months ended  Nine months ended</p>
<p>					 March 31,	   March 31,</p>
<p>					1997     1996     1997     1996</p>
<p> Total revenues		$47,976  $31,092 $127,045  $62,301</p>
<p>Charge for in-process research</p>
<p>     and development		--   24,421    8,664   24,421</p>
<p> Net income (loss)	     5,627 (22,236)    5,076 (19,536)</p>
<p>Net income (loss) per common</p>
<p>and common equivalent</p>
<p>     share			  0.27   (1.40)     0.24   (1.25)</p>
<p> Avg shrs			 21,147   15,876   20,938   15,586</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q3 and nine-month period includes a charge for the write-off of in-process research and development related to acquisitions of Setpoint Inc and DMC Corp.</p>
<p>Q3 pro forma net income without the charge: $5.6 million vs $2.1 million. Q3 pro forma earnings per share: $0.27 vs $0.13.</p>
<p>Nine-month pro forma net income: $12.0 million vs $4.9 million. Nine-month pro forma net income per share $0.58 vs $0.29.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk, 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
